        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-413 (ensure controlled execution — Toll, Parking &amp; Route Cost Management (PA-61.2).) | - CTL-413 (cost-composite accuracy — links to VS-158); operational: COO monthly sign-off
Owner: VP Supply Chain</bpmn:text>
